<p>B02 and B04 are locally verified with independent review. B05 is in progress; B03/B06 have not started. Full B15 privacy integration includes out-of-scope dependencies and cannot be completed by this authorization alone. The17 skipped-test registry remains mandatory. Live cleanup, backup location/retention approval, production verification and any rollout remain pending and prohibited in this run.</p>
<h2 id="b02-disposition">B02 disposition</h2>
<p>01-T02/03/04 have local implementation, behavioral RED, relevant owning-package GREEN, independent source review, and real demo Firestore transaction/Rules evidence. This permits the B04 code dependency handoff. It is not WO-01 completion, live-data acceptance or finding closure. The approved C01 private deletion/legacy conflict protocol supersedes the earlier planning ambiguity. <code>admin-content.js</code> required no change because its existing validator already accepts and validates the mixed editable input; the storage partition is enforced at the shared save boundary.</p>
<h2 id="b04-disposition-and-evidence-correction">B04 disposition and evidence correction</h2>
<p>01-T07/08 have independent source approval and a separate independent Node22 run of 82 focused tests. The current validator rejects nested malformed field values and unknown roots before IO, while preserving Date and trusted SDK timestamp support without a new dependency. No seed or sync main entry point was executed against Firebase.</p>
<ul><li>Original writer RED: 52 tests, 10 pass, 42 intended missing-rejection failures (<code>B04-writers-red.log</code>).</li><li>Residual RED: <code>B04-types-red.log</code> contains 12 valid intended failures and 3 invalid fixture counter mismatches. The latter do not count as RED evidence.</li><li>Corrected stats tests: 3 intended missing-exception failures against an isolated reconstruction of the prior top-level validator (<code>B04-stats-controlled-red.log</code>). This is a controlled pre-fix reproduction, not a contemporaneous baseline run. Exact source, hashes and provenance: <code>B04-stats-red-provenance.json</code>. The working source was never reverted.</li><li>Corrected focused GREEN: 82 passed, zero skips (<code>B04-types-green.log</code>). Seed package: 33 passed (<code>B04-seed-package-green.log</code>). Functions: 192 passed, zero skips; lint passed (<code>B04-functions-green.log</code>, <code>B04-functions-lint.log</code>).</li><li>Source-projection import/restore guards are not represented as real Firestore integration tests.</li></ul>
<p>This permits the B05 dependency handoff; R01/R10 remain OPEN.</p>
