<p>On 2026-10-26 the refreshed checkout is clean at <code>f3c9485</code>, which contains the existing WO-01 work and B05 producer changes. This run did not create that commit. The B05 producer logs show 33 tests with 16 intended assertion failures before fixes, focused GREEN, 206 full Functions tests passed and lint passed. The shared <code>index.js</code> bootstrap is still unchanged and its actual emulator RED check is pending. B05 is not complete or independently accepted. The interrupted earlier emulator launch produced no result and is not evidence.</p>
